    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Ki +7 and ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- High chance of performing a critical hit\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n- Launches an additional attack that has a great chance of becoming\na Super Attack\n- Guards all attacks\n- \"Realm of Gods\" Category allies' ATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g}, plus an\nadditional ATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g} for characters who also belong to\nthe \"Movie Bosses\" Category\n*When attacking*\n- ATK 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- {passiveImg:once}Damage reduction rate 50%{passiveImg:up_g} and chance of evading\nenemy's attack 20%{passiveImg:up_g} for 4 turns\n*When attacking a Super Class enemy*\n- All allies' Ki +2 for 2 turns\n*When attacking an Extreme Class enemy*\n- All allies' chance of performing a critical hit 10%{passiveImg:up_g} for 2 turns\n*For every attack received or evaded*\n- {passiveImg:forever}ATK & DEF 70%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 210%)\n*When there is another \"Movie Bosses\" Category ally attacking in\nthe same turn starting from the 5th turn from the start of battle*\n- Foresees enemy's Super Attack\n*If HP is 80% or less when attacking*\n- Launches an additional Super Attack (up to once within a turn)\n*Whenever HP is 90% or more at the end of a turn*\n- {passiveImg:forever}Damage reduction rate 20%{passiveImg:up_g} (up to 40%)",
